model new

zone create brick point 0 -10 -10 -5 ...
                  point 1 10 -10 -5  ...
                  point 2 -10 10 -5  ...
                  point 3 -10 -10 0  ...
                  size 10 10 5
                  
zone cmodel elastic 
zone initialize density 3.6e3
zone property young 10e6 poisson 0.3

model gravity 9.8

zone gridpoint fix velocity-z range pos-z  -5.1 -4.9
zone gridpoint fix velocity-x range pos-x  -10.1 -9.9
zone gridpoint fix velocity-x range pos-x  9.9 10.1
zone gridpoint fix velocity-y range pos-y  -10.1 -9.9
zone gridpoint fix velocity-y range pos-y  9.9 10.1


model cycle 1
model solve

model save "diji"
